Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.47,Leg,,0,0,0,,Na aula de hoje
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:01.75,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai aprender a fazer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:02.60,Leg,,0,0,0,,exercícios conjugados,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:03.09,Leg,,0,0,0,,ou bi-sets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.09,0:00:03.93,Leg,,0,0,0,,ou combinados.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:04.17,Leg,,0,0,0,,Vem cá que eu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:04.90,Leg,,0,0,0,,vou te mostrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:05.42,Leg,,0,0,0,,Na sua ficha vai estar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:06.18,Leg,,0,0,0,,aparecendo aqui, ó:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.07,Leg,,0,0,0,,exercício combinado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:07.31,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui vai ter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.12,Leg,,0,0,0,,um exercício
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.13,Leg,,0,0,0,,e na frente o outro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:09.92,Leg,,0,0,0,,Agora eu vou te mostrar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:10.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,como você vai fazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:11.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,Se na sua ficha tiver,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.37,Leg,,0,0,0,,por exemplo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.67,Leg,,0,0,0,,12 puxadas no triângulo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:15.24,Leg,,0,0,0,,mais 12 rosca direta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:15.87,Leg,,0,0,0,,com halter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:16.42,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai fazer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:16.68,Leg,,0,0,0,,12 puxadas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,aqui no triângulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:21.44,Leg,,0,0,0,,Fez as 12
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.71,Leg,,0,0,0,,sem descansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:23.37,Leg,,0,0,0,,você já vai pegar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.17,Leg,,0,0,0,,o halter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.30,Leg,,0,0,0,,e vai fazer mais 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.27,Leg,,0,0,0,,Acabou as 12 no halter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:30.25,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aí sim você vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:31.25,Leg,,0,0,0,,descansar 1 minuto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:31.68,Leg,,0,0,0,,e repetir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:32.67,Leg,,0,0,0,,todo esse processo.
